{"title": "Downtrends, like you're five", "type": "Explained like you're 5", "hooks": ["Downtrends explained like you're five, before you lose money.", "Your first downtrend, explained like you're five.", "Downtrends explained like you're five."], "scenes": [{"kind": "hook", "vo": "Downtrends explained like you're five, before you lose money.", "text": "Downtrends, like you're five", "chart": null}, {"kind": "stick", "head": "A ball on the stairs", "vo": "Picture a ball bouncing down the stairs. Every bounce is a little lower than the one before.", "figures": [{"pose": "stand", "label": "You", "color": "white"}], "cues": [{"say": "Picture a ball", "do": "pose", "fig": 0, "pose": "think"}, {"say": "a little lower", "do": "pose", "fig": 0, "pose": "point"}, {"say": "the one before", "do": "bubble", "fig": 0, "text": "Lower, and lower"}], "chart": null}, {"kind": "stick", "head": "Lower highs, lower lows", "vo": "Each top is lower. Each bottom is lower. That's a downtrend: lower highs and lower lows.", "figures": [{"pose": "point", "label": "Teacher", "color": "teal"}, {"pose": "think", "label": "You", "color": "white"}], "cues": [{"say": "Each top is lower", "do": "pose", "fig": 0, "pose": "pointl"}, {"say": "That's a downtrend", "do": "bubble", "fig": 0, "text": "Lower highs, lower lows"}, {"say": "lower highs and lower lows", "do": "pose", "fig": 1, "pose": "happy"}], "chart": null}, {"kind": "stick", "chart": 0, "head": "Plaza Prime, for real", "show": 50, "vo": "Here's a real one. Plaza Prime made a high and a low, then a lower high, then a lower low. Down the stairs.", "figures": [{"pose": "point", "label": "Teacher", "color": "teal"}], "cues": [{"say": "made a high", "do": "mark", "i": 48, "label": "H", "side": "high", "tone": "amber"}, {"say": "and a low", "do": "reveal", "to": 56}, {"say": "and a low", "do": "mark", "i": 54, "label": "L", "side": "low", "tone": "amber"}, {"say": "then a lower high", "do": "reveal", "to": 62}, {"say": "then a lower high", "do": "mark", "i": 58, "label": "LH", "side": "high", "tone": "red"}, {"say": "then a lower low", "do": "reveal", "to": 90}, {"say": "then a lower low", "do": "mark", "i": 84, "label": "LL", "side": "low", "tone": "red"}, {"say": "Down the stairs", "do": "pose", "fig": 0, "pose": "sad"}], "win": [20, 115]}, {"kind": "stick", "chart": 0, "head": "Then it stopped", "show": 90, "vo": "But a trend is only a trend until it stops. Over the next 25 candles, the price went up 3.3 percent.", "figures": [{"pose": "think", "label": "Teacher", "color": "teal"}], "cues": [{"say": "until it stops", "do": "bubble", "fig": 0, "text": "Wait for it"}, {"say": "Over the next 25 candles", "do": "reveal", "to": 115}, {"say": "went up 3.3 percent", "do": "pose", "fig": 0, "pose": "shrug"}, {"say": "went up 3.3 percent", "do": "shade", "from": 90, "to": 115, "tone": "green"}], "win": [20, 115]}, {"kind": "stick", "head": "Read the stairs", "vo": "So read the stairs, not one bounce. And when a step breaks the pattern, the trend may be ending.", "figures": [{"pose": "stand", "label": "Teacher", "color": "teal"}, {"pose": "stand", "label": "You", "color": "white"}], "cues": [{"say": "read the stairs", "do": "pose", "fig": 0, "pose": "point"}, {"say": "breaks the pattern", "do": "pose", "fig": 1, "pose": "think"}, {"say": "may be ending", "do": "bubble", "fig": 1, "text": "Watch the next step"}], "chart": null}, {"kind": "outro", "text": "Practise trends: memestreet.net", "vo": "Practise reading trends on fictional charts at memestreet.net.", "chart": null}], "caption": "A downtrend is a ball bouncing down the stairs.\n\nEach top lower than the last. Each bottom lower too.\nThat is how you read the trend: lower highs and lower lows.\nBut a trend is only a trend until it stops. Plaza Prime turned up right after.\n\nSave this for your next chart.\nPractise at memestreet.net\nFictional market. Not investment advice.\n\n#MemeStreet #ChartReading #LearnToTrade #Downtrend", "charts": [{"candles": [[102.